    "entrance": "Low western workshop with seed beside the portal mouth.",
    "exit": "Raised eastern balcony above the return portal well.",
    "solution": "Cut the seed left so it charges closer to the western portal mouth. Walk past it, face back toward it, and use a fresh rightward cut: the radial burst sends you left into the portal. The short runway retains enough horizontal speed for the floor outlet to turn it into useful height. Steer right after emerging onto the raised balcony. Walking into the portal supplies too little height; preparing the seed farther away loses too much speed before reaching the entrance.",
